  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>DNA methylation profiling of four DLD1 colorectal cancer cell derivatives that recapitulate EMT/MET transitions during metastasis.</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>DNA methylation profiling of four DLD1 colorectal cancer cell derivatives that recapitulate EMT/MET transitions during metastasis. The Illumina Infinium 450k Human DNA methylation Beadchip was used to obtain DNA methylation profiles across approximately 450,000 CpGs. Overall design: Bisulphite converted DNA from four DLD1 colorectal cancer cell line derivatives were analyzed with the Illumina Infinium 450k Human Methylation Beadchip</DESCRIPTION>
